  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Application ownership",
      "items": [
        "Bootstrap installs Argo CD and repository credentials, then applies apps/argocd-apps/environments/aks.",
        "The root reads platform/argocd/environments/aks; its Kustomize base declares all child Applications.",
        "Foundation groups eurotransit-secrets, traefik, cert-manager, strimzi, cloudnativepg, kube-prometheus-stack, eurotransit-monitoring-config, keycloak-operator and argo-rollouts."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Source to Kubernetes",
      "items": [
        "Runtime: platform/environments/aks composes PostgreSQL, Kafka, topics and environment patches.",
        "Marketplace: charts/eurotransit uses values.yaml + values-production.yaml; Flyway runs with the workload sync.",
        "Connectors: platform/connectors/environments/aks composes shared workers and a pinned Debezium image.",
        "Argo CD renders and applies manifests; Kubernetes controllers run Pods and pull their declared images from ACR."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Delivery boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Pushes to application main trigger conditional image builds; manual runs can select a source ref. CI directly commits configuration values after successful builds.",
        "Debezium has its own build/digest update workflow. A configuration-only change enters at Configuration Git.",
        "Application workflows inspected at dc636f4; configuration topology pinned to 02447bc. This is declared AKS topology, not evidence of a completed release.",
        "Custom child health gates wave progression. Rollouts owns live selectors/weights; Argo CD ignores those controller-managed fields. Standard Kind differs; isolated Kind HA uses direct setup."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
